{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Raccateer is a colony sim idler where you manage a crew of raccoons building a trash empire.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603870/extras/MaterialsPanCropped_-_SD_480p.gif?t=1746056692\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your production line from trash collection to manufacturing. Recruit raccoons with unique personalities and stats, then optimize your workplace to match their skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603870/extras/FastTossing2Cropped_-_SD_480p.gif?t=1746056692\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your supply chain from trash to treasure and back to trash again. Today's tech becomes tomorrow's premium garbage </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603870/extras/StorePanCrop_-_SD_480p.gif?t=1746056692\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch your workforce progress from slow beginners to lightning-fast pros. Equip them with hats and upgrades as you expand your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603870/extras/MoneyStorageCropped_-_SD_480p.gif?t=1746056692\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the quirky narrative of your raccoon team as they work their way up the trash business ladder.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603870?t=1746056692","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603870?t=1746056692","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603870/449d294db01c760098d636b4068af9c769723eb5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746056692","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co